WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
Here’s how we brought Toronto Gadgets to life!

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.300
A distinctive identity.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.600
A website built around its B2B sourcing service.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.100
Clear paths for different business needs,

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:13.300
leading visitors from exploring their options to preparing an enquiry.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.200
From the first impression to the next conversation, it all connects.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:23.500
This local business already turned memories into crystal. It needed a digital home.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:28.000
We created its name and logo: Heart in Crystal.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.100
Then we built a website around the customer’s journey.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:38.500
Upload a photo, personalise the crystal, and review the details.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:46.700
We connected payments and built a CRM to organise orders, customers and enquiries.

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:51.000
Matching content carried the identity further.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.400
From identity to everyday operations—one connected experience.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.800
The possibilities are endless!